@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade Quality - Static and Architectural Quality Signals

component "Spring Modulith module rules\npackage-info.java allowedDependencies" as ModuleRules EZ_BACKEND
component "ModulithStructureTest\nApplicationModules.verify()" as ModulithTest EZ_BACKEND
component "Maven verify in CI" as MavenVerify EZ_DEVOPS
component "TypeScript compiler config\ntsconfig.json" as TsConfig EZ_FRONTEND
component "Next lint script\npackage.json: next lint" as NextLint EZ_FRONTEND
component "Frontend CI execution\nnot present" as FrontendCiGap EZ_RISK
component "No Sonar/Checkstyle/SpotBugs found" as StaticGap EZ_RISK
component "Docker local runtime\nnot built in CI" as DockerCiGap EZ_RISK

ModuleRules --> ModulithTest : verifies dependency graph
ModulithTest --> MavenVerify : executed during test phase
TsConfig ..> NextLint : local quality tools available
NextLint ..> FrontendCiGap : script declared, but not in workflow
StaticGap ..> MavenVerify : no dedicated static analysis step
DockerCiGap ..> MavenVerify : Compose exists, but CI does not build images

note bottom
Evidence: backend package-info.java files, ModulithStructureTest.java,
frontend/package.json, frontend/tsconfig.json, docker-compose.yml, and the GitHub Actions workflow.
end note

@enduml
